    "chunk_text": "1956 REVISED EDITION\n\nFlight Attendents Union, No. 01, Jayakontha Lane, Kirula Road, Colombo 05.\n\nand\n\nSri Lankan Airlines Limited, Third Floor, Eastern Tower, World Trade Centre, Colombo 01.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nWhether the flight staff representing the Flight Attendents Union of the Sri Lanka Airline Limited have been caused injustice by the deprival of the right of enjoying casual and sick leave, which is a condition of employment and if so, to what relief they are entitled.\n\nH.M.D.N.K. Wataliyadda, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Office of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, on this 18th day of June, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0327/2"
