    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2446/45 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 24 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dc3\u0db4\u0dad\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dca\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.24\n\nNo. 2446/45 \u2013 THURSDAY, JULY 24, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThe Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy No.: DSNI/LAN/10/ACQ/51. Ministry of Land Reference No.: 4-3/8/2020/CEB/05.\n\nI hereby inform that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964.\n\nDetails of the land expected to be acquired : The lot of land mentioned below in Paper No. 01 of Zone No. 01 in Cadastral Map No. 810697, A. G. P. Plan No. 580 of Maththaka Village, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Niyagama, District of Galle, Southern Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 01 Name of the land: Maththakawelyaya alias Hathawila Kumbura; Usage of the current land: Government; Names of claimants: Marthupitiya Epage Kularathna Epa of Udagedarawatta, Maththaka and others; Extent: 21.7 perches.\n\nAll persons claiming ownership, rights or other affiliation to the aforesaid land can apply to themselves or their authorized persons on the 18th day of September, 2025 and can meet me at the Divisional Secretariat Niyagama at 10.00 a.m.\n\nFurther, before the 11th day of September 2025 they should inform me in 2 copies of the document regarding the nature of their ownership of the land and the details of the claim for compensation for obtaining the same land/possession and the amount of compensation and the amount calculated.\n\nG. P. A. Thilini, Divisional Secretary, Cover up Duties, Niyagama. Divisional Secretariat of, Niyagama, 18th July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0297\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 044943 - 24 (07/2025)"
