    "chunk_text": "G. P. A. Thilini, Divisional Secretary, Cover up Duties, Niyagama. Divisional Secretariat of, Niyagama, 18th July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0297\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 044943 - 24 (07/2025)\n\nAmendment\n\nThe Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: WAN/LND/05/AQUIS/01-L4. Land Ministry Ref. No. : 4/3/16/2019/UDA/179. I hereby notify that the date for examine the compensation in the notice published in the Gazette Extraordinary of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka No. 2429/04 dated 24.03.2025 under Section 7 shall be amended from 05.05.2025 to 27.10.2025 and the date given for submission of claims from 28.04.2025 to 17.10.2025 and the schedule including the details of the lots of land to be acquired including Lot Nos. 1 and 4 shall be amended as follows. Also, the date for examine the compensation and the date given for submission of claims for the new lot numbers included shall be the same as the above mentioned dates.\n\nSchedule Allotments of the land within the boundaries mentioned below, depicted in sheet No. 01 of Zone No. 01 in Cadastral Map No. 410058 prepared by District Superintendent of Surveys on 30th of\n\nDecember 2024 and situated in Serakkuliya Village in Serakkuliya Grama Niladhari Division No. 635/3 in Wanathawilluwa Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Puttalam District, North Western Province. Lot Number - 1 (Reserved for lagoon) Extent - 1.1329 Hectare North by - - East by - - South by - - West by - - Lot Number - 4 (Road) Extent - 0.2702 Hectare North by - Lot No. 3 East by - Lot No. 3 and 6 South by - Lot No. 3 West by - Lot No. 3 S. M. P. Nandasena, Divisional Secretary, Wanathawilluwa. At the Divisional Secretariat, Wanathawilluwa, 19th July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0298\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
