,Sridhamma Mawatha, Colombo 10 of the First Part, and the Ceylon Estate Sta\ufb00 s' Union of No. 6, Aloe Avenue, Colombo 3, of the Second Part, on this 10th day of February, Two Thousand and Twenty- Three witnessed as follows,\n\n1. Title.\u2013\n\nThis Agreement shall be known as the Plantations Technical Sta\ufb00 Collective Agreement.\n\n2. Employers Covered and Bound.\u2013"
