ATION No.: A/67/2023IR/COM/01/2022/29.\n\nBetween,\n\nMr. I.M. Upali Jayalath, Wilgamdematava, Malagane, Wariyapola.\n\nFirst Part and\n\nTokyo Super Cement Company Lanka (Pvt) Ltd, No. 469 1/1, Galle Road, Colombo 03.\n\nSecond Part\n\nARBITRAL AWARD"
