    "chunk_size_bytes": 1130,
    "chunk_text": "(a) At least three (3) simple passes (S) in any stream in one and the same sitting at the GCE Advanced Level Examination conducted by the Department of Examinations of Sri Lanka or equivalent qualification And\n\n(b) At least Credit (C) pass in Mathematics and Science not exceeding two sittings in the GCE Ordinary Level Examination conducted by the Department of Examinations of Sri Lanka or equivalent qualification\n\n2. The Institute shall conduct the degree programme specified in Schedule II hereto, only at Kandawala Estate, No. 02, General Sir John Kotalawala Mawatha, Ratmalana.\n\n3. The Institute is recognized to offer the Degree specified in Schedule II hereto, subject to a review conducted by the Specified Authority every five (5) years from the date of publication of this Order.\n\nSCHEDULE II\n\nColumn IDegreeColumn IIAbbreviations for DegreeBachelor of Science in Textile and Apparel StudiesBSc (Textile and Apparel Studies)\n\nDr. Harini Amarasuriya, Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education.\n\nColombo,18th July, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 - 0282\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
