    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.05.09PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.05.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2446/33 \u2013 2025 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 21 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dc3\u01ff\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.07.21\n\nNo. 2446/33 \u2013 MONDAY, JULY 21, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\nPILGRIMAGES ORDINANCE\n\nIT is hereby noti\ufb01ed, that the Annual Esala Festival of Historic Welle Dewalaya in the Grama Niladhari Division of Yaddehimulla, Unawatuna, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Habaraduwa, District of Galle, Southern Province, will be held during the period from Friday 8th of August 2025 to Thursday, 14th of August 2025 as per the order made under the Extraordinary Gazette Noti\ufb01cation No. : 2125/24 dated 28.05.2019 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka in terms of the regulations of the Section 2 of the Pilgrimages Ordinance (Cap. 175).\n\nW.A. DHARMASIRI, District Secretary/Government Agent, Administrative District, Galle.\n\nDistrict Secretariat,Galle,16th July, 2025.\n\nEOG 07-0256\n\n1A \u2013 G 044913\u2013 07 (07/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
