    "md5": "687ac835a6462e3d9f3428e8da8671bd",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1869,
    "chunk_text": "by Acts Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes - Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Captain M.G.G. Mendis, No. 15, John Keels Housing Scheme, Kalalgoda Road, Pannipitiya to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration. Dr. ANIL JAYANTHA FERNANDO, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,11th July, 2025.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2021/143.\n\nSwadeena Motor Ratha Sewaka Samithiya, No. 12/01, Duwana Palliya Road, Pallansena North, Kochchikade. and\n\nSri Lanka Transport Board, No. 200, Kirula Road, Colombo 05.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is\n\nWhether Mr. K. Shantha kumara Amar Perera who worked at the Bandarawela Depot of the Sri Lanka Transport Board and retired had been caused injustice by\n\n- being appointed as the cover- up Assistant Manager (Transport) from 06.04.2015,- being appointed as the Depot Manager of same Depot from 05.02.2019,- and by being removed from the then held post of Depot Manager from 19.10.2020 and being vested the duties of Fuel controller without even being given the post of Assistant Manager (Transport) (Cover- up), the post which he had held from 2015 and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\nH. M. D. N. K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the of\ufb01 ce of the Commissioner General of Labour.Colombo, this 30th day of June 2025.\n\nEOG 07 - 0249\n\nI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'07'21\n\nPART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 21.07.2025 3A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2022/19.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)"
