    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2022/19.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nHayleys Fentons Limited, No. 180, Deans Road, Colombo 10. NOW THEREFORE I, Dr. Anil Jayantha Fernando, Minister of Labour do by virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 4 (1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended by Act Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes - Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint, Mr. C.A.H.M. Wijeratne Attorney-at-Law, 31/1, HPT Main Road, Liyanagemulla, Seeduwa to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration. Dr. ANIL JAYANTHA FERNANDO, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,11th July, 2025.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2022/19.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nMr. M.M. Yusuf, No. 296/14, Torrington Avenue, Colombo 05. and\n\nHayleys Fentons Limited, No. 180, Deans Road, Colombo 10.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is\n\nWhether Mr. M.M. Yusuf who worked at Hayleys Fentons Limited has been caused injustice by the non-payment of vehicle allowance for the period from April- June 2020, special allowance and commission in respect of year 2019/2020 and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\nH. M.D.N.K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the of\ufb01 ce of the Commissioner General of Labour.Colombo this 30th day of June 2025.\n\nEOG 07 - 0250"
