    "chunk_text": "NOW THEREFORE I, Dr. Anil Jayantha Fernando, Minister of Labour do by virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 4 (1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended by Acts Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes Special Provisions) Act No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint\n\nMr. M.M.I.R.A. JayathilakeNo. 32/26 L,Anagarika Dharmapala Mawatha,Galle.\n\nDr. A\u0d87\u0d82\u0d85 J\u0d7a\u0d92\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a F\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d87\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d88, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,11th July, 2025.\n\nI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'07'21P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 21.07.2025 5A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2024/159.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nMr. J.S. Manuwansa No. 03,Devala Road, Depanama,Pannipitiya.\n\nand\n\nNawaloka Construction Company (Private) Limited12th Floor,''Nawaloka Specialist Centre\" No. 115, Sir James Peiris Mawatha,Colombo 02.\n\nStatement of matter in dispute.\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is\n\nWhether Mr. J.S. Manuwansa who worked in Nawaloka Construction Company (Private) Limited as a project Manager had been caused injustice by the non-payment of salary and allowances in respect of the period from October 2019 to July 2020 and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\nH.M.D.N.K. W\u0d7a\u0d8d\u0d7a\u0d85\u0d82\u0d92\u0d7a\u0d7d\u0d7d\u0d7a, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the O\ufb03 ce of the Commissioner General of Labour.Colombo this 07th day of July, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 - 0248"
