    "chunk_text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'07'21\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 21.07.2025 3A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nD\u0d8b. A\u0d87\u0d82\u0d85 J\u0d7a\u0d92\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a F\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d87\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d88, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,03rd July 2025.My No.: IR/COM/03/2023/171.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nSwadeena Motor Ratha Sewaka Samithiya, No.12/01, Duwana Palliya Road , North Pallansena,Kochchikade\n\nand\n\nSri Lanka Transport Board, Head O\ufb03 ce, No. 200, Kirula Road, Colombo 05\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\nWhether Mr. P. Bandula Padmakeerthi who is working as a Driver in the Sri Lanka Transport Board has been caused injustice by the disciplinary orders given after the disciplinary inquiry commenced on 18.08.2021 and if so, to what relief he is entitled. H.M.D.N.K. W\u0d7a\u0d8d\u0d7a\u0d85\u0d82\u0d92\u0d7a\u0d7d\u0d7d\u0d7a, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the O\ufb03 ce of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, on this 18th day of June, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0244"
