    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka Broadcasting Croparation, Independent Square, Colombo 07.\n\nI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.21\n\nPART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 21.07.2025 4A\n\nDr. ANIL JAYANTHA FERNANDO, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,03rd July, 2025.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2020/235.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON1956 REVISED EDITION\n\nMr. K.A.N. Premasiri, G.55, Torrington Flats, Torrington Mawatha, Colombo o5.\n\nand\n\nSri Lanka Broadcasting Croparation, Independent Square, Colombo 07.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\n\u2018\u2018Whether Mr.K.A.N. Premasiri who worked as an Additional Director of the Sri Lanka Broadcasting Corporation and retired on 20.06.2018 has been caused injustice by the below - mentioned issues and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\n- Whether Mr.K.A.N. Permasiri is entitled for the arrears of salary and allowance from 14.05.2018 the date on which the Directors of SLBC were placed in HM salary step from MM1-1 salary step upto 20.06.2018 his, date of retirement, and if so- non - paymint it\n\n- Whether there is an arrears in occoupational allowances and if so, non- payment of it\n\nH. M. D. N. K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Of\ufb01ce of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, on this 18th day of June, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0242/2\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
