    "chunk_size_bytes": 1532,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2446/02 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 21 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.21\n\nNo. 2446/02 \u2013 MONDAY, JULY 21, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 My Reference No.: DS/VN/L.ACQ/SCH-04. Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation Ref No.: 4-3/13/2021/PC/255. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose:- Description of the land servitude to be acquired: Cadastral Map No.: 910251 Block 01 Sheet No. 1 Province : Northern Distrsict: Jaffna Divisional Secretariat Division: Valikamam North, Tellippalai Grama Niladhari Division: Thanthaiselvapuram (J/230) Village: Tellippalai East Purpose: Acquisition of land for the Construction of Play ground and New Class Rooms of J/Mahajana College-Tellippalai\n\n01. Lot No. 1 Name of Land: Thottharai; Description: Garden; Name of Claimant: State; Original Claimant: A. Mathini; Extent: 0.0418 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 2 Name of Land: Thottharai; Description: Garden, Contains two Coconut trees 5-7 years old; Name of Claimant: State; Original Claimant: A. Kanakeswary; Extent: 0.0122 Hectare."
  },
