    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS Title Registration REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998 Declaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14 BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land No. 1 : 27 of Block 1, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 110775, situated in the Village of Hunupolagama (Aluthwewa nelumpathgama) within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 468-Siyabalewa in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Galnewa, in the District of Anuradhapura, in the Province of North Central, referred to in Notice No. 11/0504 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2384/20 of 14th May, 2024 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P.C. D. S\u0d82\u0d80\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7a, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 02nd July, 2025\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2445/65 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 18 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.18\n\nNo. 2445/65 \u2013 FRIDAY, JULY 18, 2025\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 044895 - 04 (07/2025)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0d