    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2445$58 - 2025 cQ,s ui 18 jeks isl=rdod - 2025'07'18No. 2445/58 - FRIDAY, JULY 18, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\n1A - PG 7209 - 05 (07/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nLocal Government Notifications\n\nDEPARTMENT OF LOCAL GOVERNMENT - EASTERN PROVINCE\n\nNotice on summon meeting of under the Local Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 22 of 2012\n\nBY virtue of power vested on me under Section 66(C) read with Section 66(G) of Local Authorities Elections Ordinance amended by Local Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 22 of 2012, I, Adam Lebbe Mohamed Azmi, the Commissioner of Local Government of Eastern Province do hereby summon the meeting to fill the vacancy arose to the post of Vice Chairman of the Lahugala Pradeshiya Sabha, Ampara District, Eastern Province at 10.30 a.m. on 01.08.2025 at Lahugala Pradeshiya Sabha Hall for the purpose of elect the new Vice Chairman. A. L. M. Azmi, Commissioner of Local Government, Eastern Province. Office of the Department of Local Government,Eastern Province,Kanniya Road, Varothaya Nagar, Trincomalee,On this 17th day of July, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 - 0235\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
