    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS Title Registration REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998 Declaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14 BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land No. 1:16 of Block 01, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 320289, situated in the Village of Haragama within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 276 Gurudeniya East in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Kandy Four Gravets and Gangawata Koralaya, in the District of Kandy, in the Province of Central, land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2398/50 of 24th August, 2011 in terms of Section 55 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. C. D. S\u0d82\u0d80\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7a, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 09th July, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2445/41 - 2025 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 16 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.16\n\nNo. 2445/41 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JULY 16, 2025\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 044872 - 04 (07/2025)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd