    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2445/33 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 16 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.16\n\nNo. 2445/33 - WEDNESDAY, JULY 16, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nReference No. : WLP/LAN/FLD04/ACQ/36.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land/servitude to be acquired : Following allotment of land depicted in Cadastral Plan bearing No. 820170 situated in the Village of Jamburegoda West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Welipitiya in the District of Matara is required to acquire for building Jamburegoda West Sewa Piyasa :\n\n01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Wemulla Kurunduwatta; Description of the Land : There is a garden, a permanent building;\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 044866 - 14 (07/2025)\n\nClaimant: Jamburegoda Gamachchi Wijayasena, Wemullawatta, Jamburegoda, Weligama; Extent: 0.0177 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid Land/servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat of Welipitiya on 27.02.2026 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 13.02.2026, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nR. S. Dilhani Nadeeka, Divisional Secretary, Welipitiya. At Divisional Secretariat Welipitiya, EOG 07 - 0196"
