    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2445$32 - 2025 cQ,s ui 16 jeks nodod - 2025'07'16No. 2445/32 - WEDNESDAY, JULY 16, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A- G 44865 - 05 (07/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSRI LANKA LIBRARIANS' SERVICE MINUTE\n\n2nd Amendment\n\nTHE Service Minute of the Sri Lanka Librarians' Service published in the Gazette Extraordinary No.2024/35 dated 21st June 2017 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as amended by the Gazette Extraordinary mentioned in part I below is amended as following part II. The other terms and conditions therein remain unchanged.\n\nBy order of the Public Service Commission,\n\nN. U. Nishan Mendis, Director General of Combined Services.\n\nOn 09th July, 2025.\n\nPart I\n\nAmendment No.01 - Gazette Extraordinary No. 2036/10 dated 11th September 2017\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'07'16Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 16.07.20252A\n\nPart II\n\nIt Should be amended as follows and the other provisions remain unchanged.\n\n8.3 Authorities for Conducting the Efficiency Bar Examinations:\n\n1st Efficiency bar:\n\n2nd Efficiency bar:\n\nIt shall be conducted by the Appointing Authority or an officer to whom such authority has been delegated, in accordance with the guidelines prescribed by the Appointing Authority.\n\nAPPENDIX III\n\n03. Authority for conducting the examination: by the Appointing Authority or an officer to whom such authority has been delegated\n\nAPPENDIX IV\n\n03. Authority for conducting the examination: by the Appointing Authority or an officer to whom such authority has been delegated\n\nEOG 07 - 0195\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
