    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS Title Registration REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998 Declaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14 BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 1 : 422, 1 : 423, 1 : 425, 1 : 426, 1 : 434, 1 : 436, 1 : 437, 1 : 438, 1 : 439, 1 : 481, 1 : 745, 1 : 746, 1 : 747, 1 : 748, 1 : 749, 1 : 750 and 1 : 758 of Block 1, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 830008, situated in the Village of Weeravila New Town within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 66 - Weeravila in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Lunugamvehera, in the District of Hambantota, in the Province of Southern, referred to in Notice No. 83/0442 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2377/12 of 26th March, 2024 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P.C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 26th June, 2025.\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2445/29 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 15 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.15\n\nNo. 2445/29 \u2013 TUESDAY, JULY 15, 2025\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 044844 - 04 (07/2025)\n\n2 A